WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:02.901
Here's the simpler way to use your three product directories

00:00:03.627 --> 00:00:07.296
Home Care Luggage Atlas and China Toy Atlas now share

00:00:07.381 --> 00:00:12.331
one workflow search compare and catch up on updates Start

00:00:12.373 --> 00:00:16.752
with Search products Enter a brand product name model character

00:00:17.307 --> 00:00:20.720
or feature The results narrow as you type Use the

00:00:20.763 --> 00:00:25.285
Brand Retailer and Category menus to focus your search Reset

00:00:25.371 --> 00:00:28.547
clears the filters and brings the catalog back Open More

00:00:28.589 --> 00:00:32.045
filters when you need a specific market currency price range

00:00:32.387 --> 00:00:36.269
or date Choose a currency before comparing prices A recent

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.872
source check is different from a product launch or the

00:00:38.915 --> 00:00:42.004
date a retailer first listed an item Those dates stay

00:00:42.047 --> 00:00:46.143
separate and missing information stays marked as not verified Click

00:00:46.186 --> 00:00:49.300
a product photo or title to inspect the details Here

00:00:49.386 --> 00:00:53.738
you'll find the exact offer available specifications source dates and

00:00:53.823 --> 00:00:56.958
photo notes Use the original source link to check current

00:00:57.086 --> 00:01:00.841
price and availability Photos may show a product family or

00:01:00.884 --> 00:01:03.700
a different variant so check the photo scope before drawing

00:01:03.742 --> 00:01:08.251
a conclusion For luggage reviewed model families appear together Choose

00:01:08.337 --> 00:01:11.835
the exact size or color offer before selecting it For

00:01:11.878 --> 00:01:15.526
toys check the market and pack description A single random

00:01:15.569 --> 00:01:18.854
box a full set and an overseas listing are different

00:01:19.025 --> 00:01:23.377
offers To compare products tick Compare on their cards Your

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:26.851
selections stay while you search other pages Open Compare to

00:01:26.894 --> 00:01:33.081
see photos prices materials dimensions source dates and evidence side

00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:36.451
by side Four products appear at a time If you've

00:01:36.494 --> 00:01:40.526
selected more use the next comparison page Remove individual products

00:01:40.824 --> 00:01:44.536
or clear the selection whenever you like Export selected CSV

00:01:44.622 --> 00:01:49.102
downloads only your chosen products Export results CSV downloads the

00:01:49.144 --> 00:01:52.453
records matching your current search and filters Both keep source

00:01:52.581 --> 00:01:55.525
links and photo URLs so you can continue your review

00:01:55.696 --> 00:02:00.261
in Excel Finally open News and updates Search the headlines

00:02:00.517 --> 00:02:03.717
or filter by update type Each entry shows its source

00:02:04.016 --> 00:02:06.768
and date New to directory means a record was added

00:02:06.896 --> 00:02:09.712
to the catalog it does not automatically mean a new

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:13.467
product launch Daily checks are scheduled and the last completed

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:16.354
review is shown clearly Use the links at the top

00:02:16.482 --> 00:02:20.407
to switch between Home Care Luggage and Toys The workflow

00:02:20.492 --> 00:02:24.716
stays the same find products inspect the evidence compare your

00:02:24.759 --> 00:02:26.210
choices and stay current
